Content: the skills distil Martin Zinkevich, "Rules of Machine Learning: Best
Practices for ML Engineering" (https://developers.google.com/machine-learning/guides/rules-of-ml,
page last updated 2025-08-25). The page is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 License (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The rules
are paraphrased and shortened here, not copied; references/rules.md links each
section of the original. Changes: rewritten in own words, grouped into skills,
Google product examples dropped or reduced.

Structure (planner, method skills, auditor, eval cases, severity verdicts) follows
this repo's forecasting plugin, which adapts it from everyday-causal-skills by
Robson Tigre (MIT); see ../forecasting/NOTICE.
